                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Germany</hi></p>
                <p>The Ministers continued their exchange of views on this subject.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Thursday, July 11, at 4 p.m.</p>
